<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>5.4. Lambda, DynamoDB và API Gateway on Báo cáo thực tập</title><link>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/</link><description>Recent content in 5.4. Lambda, DynamoDB và API Gateway on Báo cáo thực tập</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>5.4.1. Khởi tạo bảng NetworkDevices và NetworkAlerts</title><link>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-1-dynamodb/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-1-dynamodb/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="541-khởi-tạo-bảng-networkdevices-và-networkalerts">5.4.1. Khởi tạo bảng NetworkDevices và NetworkAlerts&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="mục-tiêu">Mục tiêu&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Thiết kế cơ sở dữ liệu NoSQL cho danh sách thiết bị và lịch sử cảnh báo. Dùng các bảng đã có, không tạo trùng khi không cần thiết.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="tạo-bảng">Tạo bảng&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>Mở &lt;strong>DynamoDB → Tables&lt;/strong>, Region &lt;code>us-east-1&lt;/code>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Tạo hoặc xác minh bảng &lt;strong>&lt;code>NetworkDevices&lt;/code>&lt;/strong>, Partition Key &lt;code>deviceId&lt;/code> (String), chế độ dung lượng &lt;strong>On-demand&lt;/strong>.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/33-dynamodb-networkdevices-2-items.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/33-dynamodb-networkdevices-2-items.png" alt="Hai bản ghi trong NetworkDevices" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 33 – Hai bản ghi trong NetworkDevices&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;ol start="3">
&lt;li>Tạo hoặc xác minh bảng &lt;strong>&lt;code>NetworkAlerts&lt;/code>&lt;/strong>, Partition Key &lt;code>eventId&lt;/code> (String), On-demand.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/32-dynamodb-networkalerts-7-items.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/32-dynamodb-networkalerts-7-items.png" alt="Các bản ghi trong NetworkAlerts" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 32 – Các bản ghi trong NetworkAlerts&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;ol start="4">
&lt;li>Không cần Sort Key nếu thiết kế hiện tại dùng khóa đơn; chỉ bổ sung index khi xác định được mẫu truy vấn cụ thể.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;h3 id="dữ-liệu-thiết-bị-ví-dụ">Dữ liệu thiết bị ví dụ&lt;/h3>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;deviceId&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;TEST-SW01&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;deviceName&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Switch Demo&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;deviceType&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Switch&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;ipAddress&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;10.0.0.10&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;status&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Online&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Đối với EC2, có thể lưu thêm &lt;code>instanceId&lt;/code>, &lt;code>region&lt;/code>, &lt;code>monitoringSource&lt;/code>, &lt;code>vpcId&lt;/code>. &lt;strong>Không chép nhầm InstanceId vào ô IP&lt;/strong>: &lt;code>instanceId&lt;/code> là định danh của EC2, còn &lt;code>ipAddress&lt;/code> là địa chỉ mạng.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>5.4.2. Viết Lambda netmon-api bằng Python</title><link>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-2-lambda-api/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-2-lambda-api/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="542-viết-lambda-netmon-api-bằng-python">5.4.2. Viết Lambda netmon-api bằng Python&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="mục-tiêu">Mục tiêu&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Dùng một Lambda Python &lt;code>netmon-api&lt;/code> để xử lý 8 chức năng HTTP theo phương thức và đường dẫn request, giảm nhu cầu tạo nhiều Lambda nhỏ cho đồ án.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="các-bước">Các bước&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>Vào &lt;strong>Lambda → Functions → Create function → Author from scratch&lt;/strong>; đặt tên &lt;code>netmon-api&lt;/code>, Runtime Python được AWS hỗ trợ.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/34-lambda-netmon-api-code-and-api-gateway.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/34-lambda-netmon-api-code-and-api-gateway.png" alt="Hàm netmon-api và kết nối API Gateway" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 34 – Hàm netmon-api và kết nối API Gateway&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;ol start="2">
&lt;li>Gắn &lt;strong>execution role&lt;/strong> cho phép thao tác với hai bảng DynamoDB và &lt;code>cloudwatch:GetMetricStatistics&lt;/code>, cùng CloudWatch Logs. Nên chỉ định ARN tài nguyên cụ thể cho quyền DynamoDB.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/53-lambda-netmon-api-execution-role-permissions.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/53-lambda-netmon-api-execution-role-permissions.png" alt="Execution role của Lambda netmon-api" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 53 – Execution role của Lambda netmon-api&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/54-iam-netmon-api-role-permission-policies.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/54-iam-netmon-api-role-permission-policies.png" alt="Danh sách IAM policies của role" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 54 – Danh sách IAM policies của role&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/55-iam-netmon-api-access-policy-json.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/55-iam-netmon-api-access-policy-json.png" alt="JSON chính sách quyền DynamoDB và CloudWatch" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 55 – JSON chính sách quyền DynamoDB và CloudWatch&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;ol start="3">
&lt;li>
&lt;p>Trong mã nguồn, đọc phương thức từ &lt;code>event.requestContext.http.method&lt;/code> và đường dẫn &lt;code>event.rawPath&lt;/code> của &lt;strong>HTTP API payload format 2.0&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>5.4.3. Xây dựng HTTP API Gateway với 8 Routes</title><link>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-3-api-gateway/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-3-api-gateway/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="543-xây-dựng-http-api-gateway-với-8-routes">5.4.3. Xây dựng HTTP API Gateway với 8 Routes&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="mục-tiêu">Mục tiêu&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Tạo HTTP API phục vụ thao tác quản lý NetMon và tích hợp vào Lambda &lt;code>netmon-api&lt;/code>.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="các-bước-trên-console">Các bước trên Console&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>Vào &lt;strong>API Gateway → APIs → Create API → HTTP API&lt;/strong>. Tên dùng trong nhóm: &lt;code>netmon-management-api&lt;/code>.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Tạo hoặc kiểm tra các routes sau:&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/38-api-gateway-netmon-management-api-routes.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/38-api-gateway-netmon-management-api-routes.png" alt="Tám route trên API Gateway" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 38 – Tám route trên API Gateway&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th style="text-align: left">Route&lt;/th>
 &lt;th style="text-align: left">Công dụng&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>GET /devices&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Liệt kê thiết bị&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>POST /devices&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Thêm thiết bị&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>GET /devices/{id}&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Xem chi tiết&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>PUT /devices/{id}&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Sửa thiết bị&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>DELETE /devices/{id}&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Xóa thiết bị&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>GET /alerts&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Xem cảnh báo&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>PUT /alerts/{id}&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Cập nhật xử lý cảnh báo&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">&lt;code>GET /metrics&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td style="text-align: left">Xem chỉ số CPU (theo Lambda hiện tại)&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;ol start="3">
&lt;li>Ở &lt;strong>Develop → Integrations&lt;/strong>, chọn &lt;strong>Lambda function&lt;/strong> &lt;code>netmon-api&lt;/code> tại &lt;code>us-east-1&lt;/code>, payload format &lt;strong>2.0&lt;/strong>, và gắn integration vào cả 8 routes.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/40-api-gateway-integrations-netmon-api.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/40-api-gateway-integrations-netmon-api.png" alt="API Gateway gắn với Lambda netmon-api" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 40 – API Gateway gắn với Lambda netmon-api&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;ol start="4">
&lt;li>Ở &lt;strong>Develop → CORS&lt;/strong>, cấu hình origin &lt;code>http://localhost:5500&lt;/code>, methods GET/POST/PUT/DELETE/OPTIONS, headers &lt;code>authorization&lt;/code>, &lt;code>content-type&lt;/code>; không bật credentials nếu chỉ gửi JWT trong header.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/41-api-gateway-cors-localhost-5500.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/41-api-gateway-cors-localhost-5500.png" alt="Cấu hình CORS localhost:5500" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 41 – Cấu hình CORS localhost:5500&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;ol start="5">
&lt;li>Mở &lt;strong>Deploy → Stages → &lt;code>$default&lt;/code>&lt;/strong>, kiểm tra &lt;strong>Automatic deployment = Enabled&lt;/strong>. Nếu tắt, cần deploy thủ công.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;figure class="netmon-evidence" style="margin:1.25rem 0;max-width:1080px;">
 &lt;a href="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/42-api-gateway-default-stage-auto-deploy.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&lt;img src="https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/images/netmon-workshop/42-api-gateway-default-stage-auto-deploy.png" alt="Stage $default tự động triển khai" loading="lazy" style="display:block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;" />&lt;/a>
 &lt;figcaption style="font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5;color:#666;text-align:center;margin:.45rem 0;">Ảnh 42 – Stage $default tự động triển khai&lt;/figcaption>
&lt;/figure>
&lt;h2 id="kiểm-thử-ban-đầu">Kiểm thử ban đầu&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Khi routes đã gắn JWT Authorizer, gọi &lt;code>GET /devices&lt;/code> mà &lt;strong>không&lt;/strong> gửi Authorization header phải nhận &lt;code>401 Unauthorized&lt;/code>. Điều này cho thấy lớp bảo vệ đang hoạt động; để xác nhận Lambda thật, cần thử với Access Token hợp lệ.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>5.4.4. Kiểm thử CRUD và truy vấn dữ liệu</title><link>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-4-crud-test/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://tunduncode.github.io/nguyentungduong-fcj-report/vi/5-workshop/5-4-serverless/5-4-4-crud-test/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="544-kiểm-thử-crud-và-truy-vấn-dữ-liệu">5.4.4. Kiểm thử CRUD và truy vấn dữ liệu&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="mục-tiêu">Mục tiêu&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Kiểm tra CRUD trên bảng &lt;code>NetworkDevices&lt;/code> qua Lambda/API bằng &lt;strong>bản ghi thử riêng&lt;/strong> để không thay đổi dữ liệu EC2 thật đang phục vụ đồ án.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="chuẩn-bị-bản-ghi-thử">Chuẩn bị bản ghi thử&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Sử dụng &lt;code>deviceId&lt;/code> bắt đầu bằng &lt;code>TEST-&lt;/code> và IP private dành cho ví dụ, chẳng hạn &lt;code>TEST-SW01&lt;/code>.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;deviceId&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;TEST-SW01&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;deviceName&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Switch test NetMon&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;deviceType&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Switch&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;ipAddress&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;10.0.0.250&amp;#34;&lt;/span>,
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#f92672">&amp;#34;status&amp;#34;&lt;/span>: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;Online&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="kịch-bản-crud">Kịch bản CRUD&lt;/h2>
